{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07287","headline":"至饶州寻陶十七不在寄赠 · 刘长卿","name":"至饶州寻陶十七不在寄赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谪宦投东道，逢君已北辕。\n孤蓬向何处，五柳不开门。\n去国空回首，怀贤欲诉冤。\n梅枝横岭峤，竹路过湘源。\n月下高秋雁，天南独夜猨。\n离心与流水，万里共朝昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07287.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07287","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}